        "location": "longterm-mem/internal/engram/source.go:62-66",
        "claim": "Candidates and Memories query the observations twice. ListObservations or ObservationsIncludingDeleted runs first, and mapAll then runs ObservationsIncludingDeleted again, which can be inconsistent if the data changes between the two reads. RelatedEdges is also queried once per observation, an N+1 pattern.",
